## Findings

This is the **Memos** Go server (`github.com/usememos/memos`).

**1. Component responsible**

`Runner` struct in `/bench/repo/server/runner/s3presign/runner.go` (package `s3presign`), constructed via `NewRunner`:

```go
type Runner struct {
	Store *store.Store
